From fc5aefa66bb52662ecc0d1e7d59e6db106f4d03d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Sergey Fedorov <barracuda@macos-powerpc.org>
Date: Sat, 22 Aug 2026 00:59:10 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 05/36] Gui: convert new-style connects and lambda connects to
 SIGNAL/SLOT syntax

Converts every connect()/disconnect() in src/Gui to the Qt4-compatible
string-based form. Also refactors the lambda connects (CompleteMessageWidget,
MailBoxTreeView, MessageHeadersWidget, MessageListWidget, MessageSourceWidget,
MessageView, SimplePartWidget, Window) into named private slots plus member
state where the lambda captured locals, since Qt4 has no lambda-connect
overload at all.
